{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錄一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錄一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石壁有鳥道二字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明朱白民，晚居蓮華峯下，修淨業，自號西空居士。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "熊魚山，亂信出家，得法於繼起禪師，居華山，居紺泉。金子駿初與魚山為法門友，後致命南京。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "薛家三曾主沂州書院。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伯兄官新城汶上，興水利有效。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曾謁桑弢甫先生於濼原書院，既歸杭州而卒。曾徧遊五岳，因\n以自號。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "程符為韓公復讀書處。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "車中日誦石屋詩數首。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "公末後與人書云：「心如太虛，本無生死。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四首之二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "贈劉崇如四首之一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "史自號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "飛來峯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兩墳前井同名忠泉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有淨土詩一百八首。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時坐樹下，唱佛千聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光祿成尚書後案"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潘岳、荀粲墮女人身，見質神錄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魯一子祥湖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念峯有借冰雪光發吹竹彈絲語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九品徃生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三聖接引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "功德池水"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "琉璃寶地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七重行樹"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七重闌楯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寶池澡浴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寶地經行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聲聞進修"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上善同會"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天華布地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天樂鳴空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾鳥和音"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十方往供"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無盡樓臺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無邊海會"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畫中手提念珠。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "君好放生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翁有春草閒房題額，築屋以懸之，是先賢金孝章先生故物也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錄四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "館有梅華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先生多用茅筆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彌勒院鑄像殿成放光"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自言前世為僧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高峯語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "我　世宗敘蓮池語錄，力扶淨土。　高宗雲棲諸詩，亦盛稱念\n佛功德。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "董香光手書金剛經，　高宗六\n巡浙江六度題句經後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "花嚴、法花"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二首之一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當因患痞，誦大悲呪，夢老女人授以一枝花，頓覺身輕如羽，疾\n尋愈。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0826a0301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0826a0301", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0826a0401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0826a0401", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0826a1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0826a1401", "type": "add", "text": "采【CB】，釆【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0827b1701", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0827b1701", "type": "add", "text": "但【CB】，伹【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0830a0901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0830a0901", "type": "add", "text": "圯【CB】，𡉏【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0830a1001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0830a1001", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0831b1001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0831b1001", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0832c1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0832c1401", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0834a1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0834a1401", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，己【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0834a1801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0834a1801", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0834b1601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0834b1601", "type": "add", "text": "撲【CB】，樸【卍續】"}
